"\"e48ab836-a16a-5a2a-9e33-8a1ffd516e3f\"","~A221~":"\"ef251f6e-7f69-56c6-af92-69587a5bdf28\"","~A222~":"\"ef92c313-ace7-534d-a9be-a1273244b76e\"","~A223~":"\"f3357d3d-3fb0-5c42-80ae-08323c20e447\"","~A224~":"\"f415b8a3-6fce-510d-87ff-7d63c8ddfc22\"","~A225~":"\"f43c688f-0269-503d-9a1c-4535a72efcb2\"","~A226~":"\"f6eb6f83-4036-5b98-b9a5-771e88fbdeff\"","~A227~":"\"f99dc3c0-3fe1-5be4-a3af-6ab3e3fdf2b9\"","~A228~":"\"ffa03fc3-85fa-5ed5-a9a0-4d6230ea6e5b\"","~A229~":"\"candidate_label\"","~A230~":"\"source_locators\"","~A231~":"\"Knowledge of human behavior and performance; individual differences in ability, personality, and interests; learning and motivation; psychological research methods; and the assessment and treatment of behavioral and affective disorders.\"","~A232~":"\"Knowledge of the information and techniques needed to diagnose and treat human injuries, diseases, and deformities. This includes symptoms, treatment alternatives, drug properties and interactions, and preventive health-care measures.\"","~A233~":"\"Knowledge and prediction of physical principles, laws, their interrelationships, and applications to understanding fluid, material, and atmospheric dynamics, and mechanical, electrical, atomic and sub-atomic structures and processes.\"","~A234~":"\"Communicating with people outside the organization, representing the organization to customers, the public, government, and other external sources. This information can be exchanged in person, in writing, or by telephone or e-mail.\"","~A235~":"\"Explicit agent scope selection: Reproducible ingestion, transformation, storage and operation of data pipelines; generic software/database architecture is broader than this career.\"","~A236~":"\"Performing general physical activities includes doing activities that require considerable use of your arms and legs and moving your whole body, such as climbing, lifting, balancing, walking, stooping, and handling materials.\"","~A237~":"\"Providing documentation, detailed instructions, drawings, or specifications to tell others about how devices, parts, equipment, or structures are to be fabricated, constructed, assembled, modified, maintained, or used.\"","~A238~":"\"description\"","~A239~":"\"Software to store, organize, or provide access to data represented as a set of objects, rather than tables.\"","~A240~":"\"Knowledge of principles and methods for describing the features of land, sea, and air masses, including their physical characteristics, locations, interrelationships, and distribution of plant, animal, and human life.\"","~A241~":"\"Original manifest; unspecified dates remain unknown\"","~A242~":"\"Software to enable audio or video conferences between participants using networked devices.\"","~A243~":"\"Knowledge of business and management principles involved in strategic planning, resource allocation, human resources modeling, leadership technique, production methods, and coordination of people and resources.\"","~A244~":"\"Knowledge of the practical application of engineering science and technology. This includes applying principles, techniques, procedures, and equipment to the design and production of various goods and services.\"","~A245~":"\"Knowledge of principles and methods for showing, promoting, and selling products or services. This includes marketing strategy and tactics, product demonstration, sales techniques, and sales control systems.\"","~A246~":"\"Explicit agent scope selection: Question framing, data preparation, analysis and communication; data-science and engineering references are complementary, not equivalent roles.\"","~A247~":"\"Software to create or edit numbers or text organized into rows and columns of cells. May include formulas which recalculate values based on other cells.\"","~A248~":"\"Knowledge of principles and processes for providing customer and personal services. This includes customer needs assessment, meeting quality standards for services, and evaluation of customer satisfaction.\"","~A249~":"\"Software to store, organize, or search documents or files from other software or from paper copies.\"","~A250~":"\"Knowledge of relevant equipment, policies, procedures, and strategies to promote effective local, state, or national security operations for the protection of people, data, property, and institutions.\"","~A251~":"\"Software to develop or edit web sites or individual pages.\"","~A252~":"\"Servicing, repairing, calibrating, regulating, fine-tuning, or testing machines, devices, and equipment that operate primarily on the basis of electrical or electronic (not mechanical) principles.\"","~A253~":"\"Explicit agent scope selection: Browser-based interface implementation, accessibility, testing and delivery; broad software roles do not make backend or management duties frontend requirements.\"","~A254~":"\"Knowledge of administrative and office procedures and systems such as word processing, managing files and records, stenography and transcription, designing forms, and workplace terminology.\"","~A255~":"\"837e430e-15d5-5a77-a557-7e3e02acd4b8\"","~A256~":"\"Install, configure, and maintain an organization's local area network (LAN), wide area network (WAN), data communications network, operating systems, and physical and virtual servers. Perform system monitoring and verify the integrity and availability of hardware, network, and server resources and systems. Review system and application logs and verify completion of scheduled jobs, including system backups. Analyze network and server resource consumption and control user access. Install and upgrade software and maintain software licenses. May assist in network modeling, analysis, planning, and coordination between network and data communications hardware and software.\"","~A257~":"\"Explicit agent scope selection: Network configuration, connectivity and troubleshooting; infrastructure operations and architecture are distinct source scopes.\"","~A258~":"\"Knowledge of different philosophical systems and religions. This includes their basic principles, values, ethics, ways of thinking, customs, practices, and their impact on human culture.\"","~A259~":"\"European occupational context. No personal proficiency target.\"","~A260~":"\"Giving full attention to what other people are saying, taking time to understand the points being made, asking questions as appropriate, and not interrupting at inappropriate times.\"","~A261~":"\"Knowledge of principles and procedures for personnel recruitment, selection, training, compensation and benefits, labor relations and negotiation, and personnel information systems.\"","~A262~":"\"Knowledge of media production, communication, and dissemination techniques and methods. This includes alternative ways to inform and entertain via written, oral, and visual media.\"","~A263~":"\"visually inspected source page; role description is a marked project paraphrase\"","~A264~":"\"Retain native task under its named source role; Authorized monitoring, triage, evidence and incident response; the source architect table is excluded from analyst expectations.\"","~A265~":"\"Perform planning, organization, monitoring, and control of all aspects of an IT program and the strategic utilization of resources to achieve the objectives within the agreed timelines, costs, and performance expectations. In addition, the identification, coordination, and management of project interdependencies, ensuring alignment with and achievement of business objectives.\"","~A266~":"\"Software to configure or maintain security or virtual private network (VPN) equipment.\"","~A267~":"\"Explicit agent scope selection: Visual interface hierarchy, components, responsive states and design handoff; broad interface occupations include tasks outside this career.\"","~A268~":"\"Knowledge of the structure and content of a foreign (non-English) language including the meaning and spelling of words, rules of composition and grammar, and pronunciation.\"","~A269~":"\"Software to create or manage the mapping of files, users, or other network resources to unique identifiers.\"","~A270~":"\"Knowledge of principles, methods, and procedures for diagnosis, treatment, and rehabilitation of physical and mental dysfunctions, and for career counseling and guidance.\"","~A271~":"\"Servicing, repairing, adjusting, and testing machines, devices, moving parts, and equipment that operate primarily on the basis of mechanical (not electronic) principles.\"","~A272~":"\"9096ca48-82ee-54a7-b393-c5c8328982a7\"","~A273~":"\"Knowledge of techniques and equipment for planting, growing, and harvesting food products (both plant and animal) for consumption, including storage/handling techniques.\"","~A274~":"\"Software to create, manage, or optimize content creation processes. May include collaboration or scheduling features.\"","~A275~":"\"Software to enable production of video content.\"","~A276~":"\"Knowledge of principles and methods for curriculum and training design, teaching and instruction for individuals and groups, and the measurement of training effects.\"","~A277~":"\"08/2026\"","~A278~":"\"Explicit agent scope selection: Explicitly authorized assessment, safe validation and remediation reporting; manager duties and conflicting levels do not define analyst thresholds.\"","~A279~":"\"Knowledge of raw materials, production processes, quality control, costs, and other techniques for maximizing the effective manufacture and distribution of goods.\"","~A280~":"\"Software to archive and track edits to files for comparison and reference.\"","~A281~":"\"Software to enable private communication between participants using networked devices. May include chat rooms or notification services.\"","~A282~":"\"saved_rating_changed\"","~A283~":"\"Knowledge of laws, legal codes, court procedures, precedents, government regulations, executive orders, agency rules, and the democratic political process.\"","~A284~":"\"Knowledge of materials, methods, and the tools involved in the construction or repair of houses, buildings, or other structures such as highways and roads.\"","~A285~":"\"141dec77-41c2-5b8b-8699-8c42910c1b5a\"","~A286~":"\"Software to connect a local area network (LAN) to the Internet. May provide network address translation (NAT) or route traffic between LANs.\"","~A287~":"\"Using computers and computer systems (including hardware and software) to program, write software, set up functions, enter data, or process information.\"","~A288~":"\"Identifying measures or indicators of system performance and the actions needed to improve or correct performance, relative to the goals of the system.\"","~A289~":"\"db_31_0_csv/content_model_reference.csv; Element ID=2.C.3.a\"","~A290~":"\"db_31_0_csv/content_model_reference.csv; Element ID=2.C.3.b\"","~A291~":"\"Performing for people or dealing directly with the public. This includes serving customers in restaurants and stores, and receiving clients or guests.\"","~A292~":"\"Software to store or retrieve data on a network-attached device such as a hard drive or tape drive.\"","~A293~":"\"Plan and systematic execution of processes to facilitate the transition of individuals, teams and organizations to a desired end state in a manner that is seamless, sustainable and aligned with business objectives. This includes the redirection of resources, business processes, finances and operating models, as well as stakeholder engagement to facilitate implementation and maximize adoption.\"","~A294~":"\"Knowledge of plant and animal organisms, their tissues, cells, functions, interdependencies, and interactions with each other and the environment.\"","~A295~":"\"Explicit agent scope selection: Prediction framing, model training/evaluation and reproducible inference; senior data-science and generic software roles are related references.\"","~A296~":"\"Software to create or edit text and graphics into documents such as books, magazines, brochures, or manuals.\"","~A297~":"\"Knowledge of circuit boards, processors, chips, electronic equipment, and computer hardware and software, including applications and programming.\"","~A298~":"\"Knowledge of the structure and content of the English language including the meaning and spelling of words, and rules of composition and grammar.\"","~A299~":"\"Local unit-group classification; consult source surrounding rows for task descriptions\"","~A300~":"\"Knowledge of economic and accounting principles and practices, the financial markets, banking, and the analysis and reporting of financial data.\"","~A301~":"\"Providing personal assistance, medical attention, emotional support, or other personal care to others such as coworkers, customers, or patients.\"","~A302~":"\"Software to create, edit, store, or print documents.\"","~A303~":"\"Identifying information by categorizing, estimating, recognizing differences or similarities, and detecting changes in circumstances or events.\"","~A304~":"\"Identifying the educational needs of others, developing formal educational or training programs or classes, and teaching or instructing others.\"","~A305~":"\"Knowledge of group behavior and dynamics, societal trends and influences, human migrations, ethnicity, cultures, and their history and origins.\"","~A306~":"\"318b9b94-abde-54a0-be25-9bd859828fe1\"","~A307~":"\"Running, maneuvering, navigating, or driving vehicles or mechanized equipment, such as forklifts, passenger vehicles, aircraft, or watercraft.\"","~A308~":"\"Software to provide word processing, spreadsheet, e-mail, presentations, or data management capabilities.\"","~A309~":"\"Software to provide or interact with telephone system, address book, fax, or e-mail services.\"","~A310~":"\"Knowledge of design techniques, tools, and principles involved in production of precision technical plans, blueprints, drawings, and models.\"","~A311~":"\"0ba016c9-de90-53ba-9456-a56d7e5740a8\"","~A312~":"\"2118452a-f76e-57e7-b940-9a31edbef7a2\"","~A313~":"\"23a5429f-eca8-5526-9cee-81b471a2bda2\"","~A314~":"\"2bff110d-3155-563c-945b-d108fd4cf578\"","~A315~":"\"4229005c-3a67-539b-ab0f-8e0904dfe3f5\"","~A316~":"\"7b75c272-35f2-5f71-8313-954ed50fd823\"","~A317~":"\"8f238aa0-16bb-5d84-a333-a7cab2ac7763\"","~A318~":"\"Software to create visual representations of business work flows, also called flow charts or workflow diagrams.\"","~A319~":"\"a0deff25-5502-5383-9394-33eba3488a57\"","~A320~":"\"c1940aa0-230b-50bc-9d2a-d49f312ce45c\"","~A321~":"\"c267b8d5-2151-539b-acf0-f041151bc6a0\"","~A322~":"\"f9d0a8b3-fe5a-554d-908d-5e5b900c0925\"","~A323~":"\"Develop a test strategy and systematic test procedures to verify and ensure that a product, system or technical solution meets its design specifications as well as the performance, load and volume levels set out. This includes the ability to define when different requirements will be verified across the product life stages, the tools used to perform the test, the data and/or resources needed to conduct the tests and testware in test cases, test scripts, test reports and test plans required.\"","~A324~":"\"relationship\"","~A325~":"\"Knowledge of the theory and techniques required to compose, produce, and perform works of music, dance, visual arts, drama, and sculpture.\"","~A326~":"\"Conceptualise, project and make enhancement of the user\\u2019s interaction and engagement with an IT product and/or service based on a robust analysis and understanding of the product and/or service\\u2019s performance vis- a-vis the user\\u2019s desired experience and outcomes. This involves creating wire frames to adequately guide and inform subsequent planning and development processes, and making enhancements to optimize the user\\u2019s experience of the product and/or service.\"","~A327~":"\"Identifying the developmental needs of others and coaching, mentoring, or otherwise helping others to improve their knowledge or skills.\"","~A328~":"\"Software to enable remote access of a computer system across a network.\"","~A329~":"\"Using relevant information and individual judgment to determine whether events or processes comply with laws, regulations, or standards.\"","~A330~":"\"related_source_ids\"","~A331~":"\"Software to manage, plan, analyze, or automate marketing campaigns, content creation, or social media interactions.\"","~A332~":"\"Software to manage activities across enterprise IT systems, such as evaluating capacity or server availability, monitoring user activities, or installing software.\"","~A333~":"\"Knowledge of principles and methods for moving people or goods by air, rail, sea, or road, including the relative costs and benefits.\"","~A334~":"\"Selecting and using training/instructional methods and procedures appropriate for the situation when learning or teaching new things.\"","~A335~":"\"Using logic and reasoning to identify the strengths and weaknesses of alternative solutions, conclusions, or approaches to problems.\"","~A336~":"\"46b37755-c67f-5aec-b01a-ee35f1c27e09\"","~A337~":"\"47d3a507-1eb4-5533-a70e-3f6da547ad52\"","~A338~":"\"Create and refine the overall plan for the design of software, including the design of functional specifications starting from the defined business requirements as well as the consideration and incorporation of various controls, functionality and interoperability of different elements into a design blueprint or model which describes the overall architecture in hardware, software, databases, and third party frameworks that the software will use or interact with.\"","~A339~":"\"Estimating sizes, distances, and quantities; or determining time, costs, resources, or materials needed to perform a work activity.\"","~A340~":"\"Using either control mechanisms or direct physical activity to operate machines or processes (not including computers or vehicles).\"","~A341~":"\"Developing, designing, or creating new applications, ideas, relationships, systems, or products, including artistic contributions.\"","~A342~":"\"Identifying the underlying principles, reasons, or facts of information by breaking down information or data into separate parts.\"","~A343~":"\"Monitoring/Assessing performance of yourself, other individuals, or organizations to make improvements or take corrective action.\"","~A344~":"\"Explicit agent scope selection: Research, synthesis, flows, prototyping and usability evidence; UI and UX remain distinct despite a shared O*NET occupation.\"","~A345~":"\"Explicit agent scope selection: Low-voltage circuit and PCB design, review and testing; semiconductor circuit roles are narrower than the general career.\"","~A346~":"\"09a71265-737b-588f-aea8-ee590dc8cc72\"","~A347~":"\"181a99c4-1bea-5224-b1ad-fe52fcb1a0cd\"","~A348~":"\"2dfa46b9-03ea-5497-b2b6-770ded260a55\"","~A349~":"\"3bfe9cbe-4fdb-5c54-b1be-c2dc17f15f19\"","~A350~":"\"42729ab8-c216-50a9-bfb3-d74a5d511d22\"","~A351~":"\"7433e659-cb4f-52d3-8d30-34e40f0d7e7f\"","~A352~":"\"74e66fe8-fa23-59d3-8d2b-269128bfe12d\"","~A353~":"\"768f88c2-18c3-55a5-a043-c67b7c6976d2\"","~A354~":"\"8ed82261-9a72-5369-b8d3-1e1492487471\"","~A355~":"\"aafafec2-fd12-509a-8e8c-2a6646fc7478\"","~A356~":"\"df9ab16d-839e-55e6-bc11-9ad6b5ad6e43\"","~A357~":"\"ff539838-c2ad-59f6-91f7-fd76d16f0769\"","~A358~":"\"native label and role expectation; full functional definition not transcribed in this release\"","~A359~":"\"Manage stakeholder expectations and needs by aligning those with requirements and objectives of the organization. This involves planning of actions to effectively communicate with, negotiate with and influence stakeholders.\"","~A360~":"\"Develop applications based on the design specifications; encompassing coding, testing, debugging, documenting and reviewing and/or refining it across the application development stages in accordance with defined standards for development and security. The complexity of the application may range from a basic application to a context-aware and/or augmented reality application that incorporates predictive behavior analytics, geo- spatial capabilities and other appropriate algorithms. The technical skill includes the analysis and possibly the reuse, improvement, reconfiguration, addition or integration of existing and/or new application components.\"","~A361~":"\"0d138bbc-8ca6-5732-a23d-41a92e29bfa9\"","~A362~":"\"Develop and implement a set of techniques or analytics applications to transform raw data into meaningful information using data-oriented programming languages and visualization software. Apply data mining, data modeling, natural language processing, and machine learning to extract and analyze information from large structured and unstructured datasets. Visualize, interpret, and report data findings. May create dynamic data reports.\"","~A363~":"\"Develop applications based on the design specifications; encompassing coding, testing, debugging, documenting and reviewing and/or refining it across the application development stages in accordance with defined standards for development and security. The complexity of the application may range from a basic application to a context-aware and/or augmented reality application that incorporates predictive behavior analytics, geo-spatial capabilities and other appropriate algorithms. The technical skill includes the analysis and possibly the reuse, improvement, reconfiguration, addition or integration of existing and/or new application components.\"","~A364~":"\"d7ec5cb3-c045-5790-a1f1-17a877374cb5\"","~A365~":"\"Software to manage network access capabilities or policies.\"","~A366~":"\"Determining how a system should work and how changes in conditions, operations, and the environment will affect outcomes.\"","~A367~":"\"39ba3976-e211-5c0d-99c0-cc3bb8c2f962\"","~A368~":"\"4855abc1-3a1a-5c2d-8ed8-390dad9552c3\"","~A369~":"\"aa724783-7a67-5f79-9507-999486b1a4b9\"","~A370~":"\"adeea3c5-ec9a-5318-9456-9dac66f9fb3a\"","~A371~":"\"c97e0a79-d4ee-5710-8719-42de6384b82c\"","~A372~":"\"Identifying complex problems and reviewing related information to d